Warning [L0101] (unused_local_binding): Local binding `err` is never read.
  --> tests/ui_lint/message_text.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     body :: req.body().text(1048576) ?? "fallback"
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A binding that no later expression reads adds dead code and may hide a computed result that should have been used.
 Fix: Remove the binding when its initializer is side-effect free, or rename `err` to `_err` when the value must be computed.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0101

